Transport fixtures prove actor-free versioned rescan input, one request without
policy prefetch, no proxy/redirect/retry, safe malformed/unknown-version/private
error responses, the streaming 64-KiB response bound, dropped connections and
cached harness JSON/text output. Input cannot select an actor or state
