schema/HTTP/server/runtime contracts and formats are unchanged. Required lanes
are the complete direct CLI fixture, owning CLI library and agent setup/local
backend consumers, CLI all-target check and strict lint,
formatting/boundary/architecture/canonical/progress checks.

Final E-M17-054 acceptance passes seven direct executable, ten CLI library, six
setup and two local backend entries in explicit serial execution, plus CLI
all-target compilation and strict lint. Both original regressions go from one
failure to zero. No original assertion, worker deadline or fixture bound is
