Foreground durable-pause handoff for JST-COLLAB-017/JST-COLLAB-030 is
additionally qualified by
`process::tests::capture_factory::controls::cold_control_policy_is_revalidated_before_foreground_dispatch`
in `crates/jj-store-server/src/process/tests/capture_factory/controls.rs`
([E-M17-050](milestones.md)). Ten fresh subprocesses cover persisted pause,
pause/resume selected after preparation, missing root or selected policy before
preparation, and missing policy, changed generation/installation, or replaced
lock/directory after preparation. The original persisted-pause case fails with a
ready/dispatched runtime and passes with a settled pause. Missing state cannot
create replacement policy or source/spool state; failed handoff never starts
discovery or the scanner. Paused startup observes no transcript or source
enrollment. Valid later resume arms existing history without publishing it.
Existing cold factory/foreground and direct runtime cases remain required for
this shared startup path. These tests use native MemoryStore fixtures and an
external S3 client constructed without requests, plus real private filesystem
state. They do not qualify real RustFS, live harness, authenticated management,
file-policy watching or public automatic enabled startup.

Installation-private pause selection for JST-COLLAB-017/JST-COLLAB-030 is
additionally qualified in
`crates/jj-store-server/tests/capture_control_state.rs` and its safety/capacity
leaves, plus the post-replacement fault in
`crates/jj-store-server/src/capture_control_state/tests.rs`
([E-M17-049](milestones.md)). Real private filesystem tests cover reopen, exact
actor/request replay without reversing a newer policy, changed reuse, missing,
corrupt and foreign state, replaced directory/lock, symlinks, unsafe
permissions, unknown files, independent-handle contention, bounded candidate
cleanup and a full 4096-receipt catalog. The lock replacement case failed before
physical lock pinning and passes afterward. A real lock disappearance injected
after selected file replacement returns OutcomeUnknown; restoring the exact lock
and replaying the original request recovers its receipt without another
revision. This device policy capability grants no runtime action,
authentication, repository authority or automatic enablement. Foreground
composition and authenticated management remain separate gates. No MemoryStore,
RustFS or live harness result is claimed by these journal tests.

Settled pause handoff for JST-COLLAB-017/JST-COLLAB-030 is additionally
qualified by the `runtime_handoff_preserves_settled_pause_until_explicit_resume`
case in `crates/jj-store-server/tests/capture_runtime/controls.rs`
([E-M17-048](milestones.md)). The before regression starts a paused supervisor
